WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.090
Resolve a ticket only after you've tested the fix.

00:00:03.090 --> 00:00:07.440
In Resolution Center, choose Mark Resolved to open the resolution dialog.

00:00:07.440 --> 00:00:08.980
The summary is required.

00:00:08.980 --> 00:00:13.390
Describe the repair and how you verified it; add the root cause if you know it.

00:00:13.390 --> 00:00:15.330
Select Confirm Resolution.

00:00:15.330 --> 00:00:17.870
The status badge should now read Resolved.

00:00:17.870 --> 00:00:20.300
A note alone would not have changed the status.
